on DelayAnim
  [  0] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [  2] extcall 71 .............................. startTimer()
  [  5] pushint8 34 ............................. <34>
  [  8] get 7 ................................... <the timer>
  [ 10] pushint8 6 .............................. <6>
